, 1220], [1628, 1264], [1220, 1267]]}, {"text": "b. adverbial clause", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[783, 1253], [1076, 1238], [1078, 1274], [785, 1289]]}, {"text": "a.prepositional phrase", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[302, 1278], [659, 1260], [661, 1297], [304, 1315]]}, {"text": "Figurative Language", "conf": 0.846, "box": [[238, 1453], [577, 1443], [578, 1480], [239, 1490]]}, {"text": "its overall impact.", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[227, 1557], [507, 1550], [507, 1590], [228, 1597]]}, {"text": "Simile:", "conf": 0.871, "box": [[223, 1608], [346, 1605], [347, 1646], [224, 1648]]}, {"text": "A simile is a figure of speech that compares two things using the words \"like\" or \"as.\" It", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[222, 1655], [1650, 1624], [1651, 1674], [223, 1705]]}, {"text": "helps us understand something better by showing a similarity between two different", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[222, 1713], [1614, 1684], [1615, 1730], [223, 1759]]}, {"text": "things. For example, Her smile is as bright as the sun is a simile because it compares the", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[220, 1764], [1660, 1741], [1661, 1789], [221, 1812]]}, {"text": "brightness of her smile to the brightness of the sun using the word \"as.\"", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[220, 1821], [1375, 1805], [1375, 1847], [221, 1864]]}, {"text": "Metaphor:", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[222, 1929], [401, 1929], [401, 1970], [222, 1970]]}, {"text": "A metaphor is a figure of speech that directly says one thing is another to create a strong,", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[217, 1981], [1681, 1979], [1681, 2021], [218, 2023]]}, {"text": "imaginative comparison. Unlike a simile, it doesn't use \"like\" or \"as.\" For example, The", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[216, 2034], [1612, 2033], [1612, 2079], [217, 2080]]}, {"text": "world is a stage is a metaphor that implies the world is like a stage where people play their", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[206, 2086], [1692, 2084], [1692, 2143], [207, 2145]]}, {"text": "roles.", "conf": 0.813, "box": [[210, 2139], [303, 2142], [302, 2185], [209, 2182]]}, {"text": "97", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[882, 2250], [936, 2250], [936, 2295], [882, 2295]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[1291, 2301], [1594, 2291], [1595, 2334], [1292, 2344]]}]}